/-!
No quotient is taken in this construction.

`Carrier natural_data` is `Option Element` directly -- `none` for the new
zero, `some n` for an embedded one-based natural -- with no representatives
to identify. There is no equivalence relation to define or quotient by
here, for the same reason there is none in `VonNeumann.Equivalence`,
`Presburger.Equivalence`, or `Landau.Equivalence`. See those files.
-/
